Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Red Hills with Flowers, 1940. Oil on canvas, 12 x 30 1/8 inches. Art Institute of Chicago. Bequest of Mary P. Hines, 2022.618. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"12 x 30 1/8 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"Georgia O’Keeffe (1887–1986), New York and New Mexico, then Abiquiu, NM, from 1949; consigned to Gerald Peters Gallery, Santa Fe, 1985 [this and the following according to email from Gerald Peters Gallery, Jan. 28, 2022; copy in curatorial object file]; sold to Jack Warner (1917-2017), Tuscaloosa, AL, 1985; consigned to Gerald Peters Gallery, Santa Fe, 1996; sold to Mary P. Hines (1931–2020; born Mary Pick), Winnetka, IL, 1997; bequeathed to the Art Institute of Chicago, 2022. (Source: Art Institute of Chicago, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Red Hills with Flowers, 1940","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Bequest of Mary P. Hines, 2022.618","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Art Institute of Chicago","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Sloping, reddish-brown hills with deep crags sweep diagonally across the canvas. Low green bushes with white flowers dot the hills. Tall mountains stand in the upper right corner of the image. A stretch of blue sky with strips of white clouds expands above the landscape.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/871273/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/871273"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}